  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "sentence": "On the day Jane Goodall turned 90, I sat down at a small table with her.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 16,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 5.675,
      "duration": 5.675,
      "phoneme_count": 78
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "sentence": "It was April 2024, and she was in Manhattan to promote a partnership with a jewelry company, Brilliant Earth.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 19,
      "start_time": 5.675,
      "end_time": 14.075,
      "duration": 8.4,
      "phoneme_count": 125
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "sentence": "The company was making a $100,000 donation to support the Jane Goodall Institute, and she was giving her name to an eco-friendly line of necklaces, rings and earrings.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 28,
      "start_time": 14.075,
      "end_time": 26.925,
      "duration": 12.85,
      "phoneme_count": 186
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "sentence": "The gold would all be recycled and the diamonds would come only from labs.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 14,
      "start_time": 26.925,
      "end_time": 32.4,
      "duration": 5.475,
      "phoneme_count": 73
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "sentence": "No mining involved.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 3,
      "start_time": 32.4,
      "end_time": 34.55,
      "duration": 2.15,
      "phoneme_count": 20
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "sentence": "People buzzed around; a lunch would be served, and fashion influencers were on hand.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 14,
      "start_time": 34.55,
      "end_time": 40.475,
      "duration": 5.925,
      "phoneme_count": 82
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "sentence": "Dr.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 1,
      "start_time": 40.475,
      "end_time": 41.95,
      "duration": 1.475,
      "phoneme_count": 7
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "sentence": "Goodall looked small and tired amid the hubbub.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 8,
      "start_time": 41.95,
      "end_time": 45.3,
      "duration": 3.35,
      "phoneme_count": 46
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "sentence": "I knew the question I wanted to start with.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 9,
      "start_time": 45.3,
      "end_time": 48.575,
      "duration": 3.275,
      "phoneme_count": 44
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sentence": "\u201cWhen you woke up this morning, on your actual 90th birthday, what was the first thing you thought?\u201d I asked.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 20,
      "start_time": 48.575,
      "end_time": 55.875,
      "duration": 7.3,
      "phoneme_count": 110
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "sentence": "The room was so loud that I had to lean forward to hear her response.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 15,
      "start_time": 55.875,
      "end_time": 60.7,
      "duration": 4.825,
      "phoneme_count": 70
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "sentence": "\u201cThat I wish I was somewhere else,\u201d she said.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 9,
      "start_time": 60.7,
      "end_time": 63.95,
      "duration": 3.25,
      "phoneme_count": 46
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "sentence": "It wasn\u2019t the answer I expected.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 6,
      "start_time": 63.95,
      "end_time": 66.7,
      "duration": 2.75,
      "phoneme_count": 36
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "sentence": "Relistening to the tape of our interview on Wednesday, the day she died, I hear my voice change from cheery to concerned.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 22,
      "start_time": 66.7,
      "end_time": 74.8,
      "duration": 8.1,
      "phoneme_count": 117
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "sentence": "\u201cWell, you know, I like being out in nature,\u201d she explained.",
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "word_count": 11,
      "start_time": 74.8,
      "end_time": 78.7,
      "duration": 3.9,
      "phoneme_count": 58
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "sentence": "Then she told me about all the birthday greetings she woke up to, and how she thought of her family and friends.",
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "word_count": 22,
      "start_time": 78.7,
      "end_time": 85.975,
      "duration": 7.275,
      "phoneme_count": 108
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "sentence": "This day wasn\u2019t about that, she said, seeming a little sad but resolved.",
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "word_count": 13,
      "start_time": 85.975,
      "end_time": 91.1,
      "duration": 5.125,
      "phoneme_count": 73
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "sentence": "\u201cThis birthday is about my mission, which is getting the word out to people around the world and raising money for our projects,\u201d she said.",
      "paragraph_id": 7,
      "word_count": 25,
      "start_time": 91.1,
      "end_time": 100.2,
      "duration": 9.1,
      "phoneme_count": 137
    }
  ]
}